					"font-size": {
						"type": "float",
						"value": 19
					},
					"text": {
						"type": "string",
						"value": "ELEMENT\n\nThe Element node retrieves a single element from a type that has multiple elements.\nThis node can extract a single channel from a Texture2Drgba or a single element from a Float 2\/3\/4 type.\n\nThis is similar to using the Unpack node, which gets you all elements from a given type as separate channels. But using the Element node can be more performant when you only need a specific element from a type.\n"
					}
				},
